"""
go-rotate: opencode-go multi-key manager CLI (shares go-keys.json with go-rotate.ts plugin)

Usage:
  go-rotate status           show current key and cooldown status
  go-rotate list             alias of status
  go-rotate init             interactive first-time setup
  go-rotate web              start the web UI standalone (no opencode needed)
  go-rotate web on|off|status  toggle auto-start web on opencode launch (off = no port, rotation still works)
  go-rotate gateway {start|stop|restart|status|logs [n]|plan [go|zen]|token [gen|clear|set <v>]|set <name>|next [min]|cooldown <name> [min|clear]}  manage zen-gateway service + gateway-domain key rotation
  go-rotate go {set <name>|next [min]|cooldown <name> [min|clear]}  go 套餐域 key 轮换（写 current_go / cooldown_until_go，不碰 auth.json）
  go-rotate set <name>       switch to a named key (zen 域, and sync auth.json)
  go-rotate next [minutes]   rotate to next available key (zen 域, optional cooldown minutes)
  go-rotate add <name> <key> add a key
  go-rotate cooldown <name> [minutes|clear]  set cooldown (zen 域; or 'clear'/0 to cancel)
  go-rotate cooldown <name> window <min|clear>  set/clear per-key cooldown window (fallback to global)
  go-rotate check [name] [--plan zen|go]  probe key health dual-endpoint (zen + go; --plan 单端点)
  go-rotate stats            show per-key rotation/cooling stats from the log
  go-rotate uninstall [-y]   uninstall (remove plugin, CLI, config)

Config:      ~/.config/opencode/go-keys.json
Sync target: ~/.local/share/opencode/auth.json -> opencode-go.key
"""
